  "notes": "ADAC-Flugplatzrennen Wunstorf, 1982-1992 layout (clockwise per the Commons diagram arrow, unverified): start/finish south-westbound on runway 03/21, hairpin at its SW end, the perimeter road north with esses to the west end of runway 08/26, east along 08/26 and a sweeping right back onto 03/21. The perimeter road is not in today's OSM: it is reconstructed as a bridge polyline by mapping the 1993 Commons diagram (which has a north arrow) onto the runway ends with an affine fit. Chicanes unverified and not modelled. Traced 4554 m vs 5050 m: the reconstructed perimeter road and the 1991 sweeper are approximations."
